---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-shell">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">VIAJES CON CRITERIO · CRUZANDO MERIDIANOS</p>

      <h1>
        Tú imaginas el viaje.<br />
        Nosotros hacemos el trabajo.
      </h1>

      <p class="description">
        Investigamos el destino, comparamos opciones y damos forma a una ruta
        con sentido para que tú puedas dedicarte a lo importante:
        disfrutar del viaje.
      </p>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a href="/cuentatuviaje" class="button-primary">
          Cuéntanos tu viaje
        </a>

        <a href="/viajes" class="button-secondary">
          Ver destinos
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hero-mark-ring hero-mark-ring--outer"></div>
      <div class="hero-mark-ring hero-mark-ring--inner"></div>
      <span class="hero-mark-dot"></span>
      <span class="hero-mark-word">CM</span>
      <span class="hero-mark-caption">ENTENDER · ELEGIR · VIVIR</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: min(760px, calc(100vh - 80px));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 5rem 2rem 6rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-shell {
    position: relative;
    width: min(1120px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 940px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-cobre);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 16ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 7vw, 6.8rem);
    line-height: 0.97;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .description {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-texto-suave, #555);
  }

  .buttons {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .button-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 52px;
    padding: 0.95rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-bosque);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease;
  }

  .button-primary:hover,
  .button-primary:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
  }

  .button-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--color-bosque);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .button-secondary span {
    transition: transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .button-secondary:hover span,
  .button-secondary:focus-visible span {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .hero-mark {
    position: absolute;
    right: -5.5rem;
    bottom: -6.5rem;
    width: 31rem;
    height: 31rem;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.78;
  }

  .hero-mark-ring {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border: 1px solid rgb(28 48 38 / 9%);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .hero-mark-ring--outer {
    transform: rotate(-12deg) scale(0.98, 0.74);
    border-left-color: rgb(194 125 56 / 28%);
  }

  .hero-mark-ring--inner {
    inset: 2.8rem;
    transform: rotate(18deg) scale(0.98, 0.74);
    border-right-color: rgb(194 125 56 / 18%);
  }

  .hero-mark-dot {
    position: absolute;
    top: 8.8rem;
    right: 5.4rem;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-cobre);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgb(194 125 56 / 9%);
  }

  .hero-mark-word {
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.5rem;
    bottom: 4.2rem;
    color: rgb(28 48 38 / 7%);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(10rem, 20vw, 15rem);
    line-height: 0.78;
    letter-spacing: -0.08em;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .hero-mark-caption {
    position: absolute;
    right: 2rem;
    bottom: 1.8rem;
    color: rgb(28 48 38 / 32%);
    font-size: 0.56rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .hero-mark {
      right: -11rem;
      bottom: -7rem;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 4.5rem 1.25rem 4.75rem;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 12ch;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 13vw, 4.7rem);
    }

    .description {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .buttons {
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-mark {
      right: -13rem;
      bottom: -10rem;
      opacity: 0.42;
    }

    .hero-mark-caption {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .hero-mark {
      right: -15rem;
      bottom: -11rem;
      opacity: 0.28;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .button-primary,
    .button-secondary span {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
